---
title: "Sequence: booking request and confirmation"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Customer
    participant B as Browser
    participant V as vehical-details.php
    participant P as pricing.php
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Py as ml/batch_forecast.py
    participant M as mailer.php
    participant I as invoice.php
    actor A as Admin
    U->>B: Book now (fromdate, todate, message)
    B->>V: POST car/<name>-<id> (+ csrf_token, checked in security.php)
    V->>V: logged in? dates valid (inclusive days)?
    V->>DB: overlapping booking for the car? (prepared)
    V->>P: public_quote(car, from, to) (browser prices are ignored)
    P->>DB: forecast day prices
    P-->>V: total + per-day prices + reasons
    V->>DB: INSERT tblbooking (quoted_price, pricing_details, priced_at)
    V->>P: forecast_request_recompute('new booking')
    P-)Py: start in background (DB settings in the environment)
    V->>M: mail_booking_received() (only if SMTP is set up)
    V-->>B: 303 to my-booking + "Booking request sent (booking no., Rs X)"
    A->>DB: Confirm (POST aeid + CSRF) -> admin_booking_set_status(): clash check, Status = 1
    A->>M: mail_booking_confirmed()
    U->>I: GET invoice?booking=no. (login required, owner only)
    I->>DB: booking + stored quoted_price and per-day details
    I-->>U: printable invoice at the stored price
